WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
CLINT BARTON
This is gonna be the best Christmas ever!

00:00:03.051 --> 00:00:04.879
♪♪

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.382
So, I took the kids to New York.

00:00:07.984 --> 00:00:08.984
To see a show.

00:00:09.898 --> 00:00:11.136
KATE BISHOP
Sounds pretty cool to me.

00:00:11.766 --> 00:00:14.640
CLINT BARTON
And then people started trying to kill us.

00:00:17.128 --> 00:00:18.011
KATE BISHOP
Actually, it's pretty bad

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:19.039
when you think about it.

00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:21.749
♫ It's the most wonderful time ♫

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:22.789
LAURA BARTON
Let me guess, you're gonna need

00:00:22.839 --> 00:00:23.430
another day.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.274
CLINT BARTON
Or two?

00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:26.542
[Groans]

00:00:27.423 --> 00:00:28.487
Things have gotten...

00:00:29.284 --> 00:00:30.322
...complicated.

00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:32.191
Probably should have
brought more guys.

00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:35.102
Oh, good. You did.

00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:41.753
♫ It's the most wonderful time
Yes, the most wonderful time ♫

00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:43.045
CLINT BARTON
We're out of regular arrows.

00:00:43.854 --> 00:00:45.146
KATE BISHOP
Oh my God, trick arrows?

00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:48.966
There are arrows more
dangerous than that one?

00:00:53.227 --> 00:00:55.227
CLINT BARTON
Ugh, this is some Christmas.

